15 个与 CryptoBilis 设备相关的账户损失了当前价值约 $102 million 的加密货币。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://www.zetter-zeroday.com/who-is-planting-backdoors-in-ledger-crypto-wallets/","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T09:37:24.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/1310f1e591d2873e20ae883692463f02caafc89a6fd9df503ba7909df64260a0.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp 96w","itemId":"rtnv85sdaekar5byu79e89sfc","title":"多款PDF编辑器存在AES-256密钥生成漏洞，可无密码解密文档","summary":"某团队发现MuPDF、Foxit等PDF编辑器在生成AES-256文件密钥时使用不安全的随机数源（如drand48 LCG、时间戳哈希等），导致密钥空间被压缩至512种可能。攻击者可通过枚举时间戳（每512秒重复）或内存信息（如Foxit）猜测密钥，实现无密码解密。其中MuPDF已修复至1.28.5版本，但Foxit等仍存在漏洞。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://v12.sh/blog/the-case-of-the-9bit-aes-key","publishedAt":"2026-10-28T20:51:44.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/1310f1e591d2873e20ae883692463f02caafc89a6fd9df503ba7909df64260a0.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp 96w","itemId":"vl523h4hv0ljftz0s421l660m","title":"eMudhra 八个中级 CA 私钥泄露，主流根程序已封禁相关证书","summary":"eMudhra 的 8 个中级 CA 证书私钥被泄露，这些证书链向 Mozilla、Microsoft、Apple 和 Chrome 根程序所信任的根。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com/","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T13:58:33.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/568b85bb709828708c1264e2e34d1be9e33dd79ab1252f93683cd06ca22d4e81.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db